      "name": "Yobuko Morning Market",
      "description": "One of Japan's three great morning markets, held daily along Yobuko Port since the Edo period. Vendors sell fresh-caught squid, dried fish, local produce, and crafts. Famous for live squid sashimi served at nearby waterfront restaurants.",
      "highlights": [
        "Fresh seafood straight from Yobuko Port",
        "Live squid sashimi at waterfront restaurants",
        "Traditional market atmosphere since the Edo period"
      ],
      "openingHours": "07:30–12:00 (daily, best from 08:00)"
    },
    "ja": {
      "name": "呼子朝市",
      "description": "日本三大朝市の一つで、江戸時代から続く呼子港の朝市。獲れたてのイカや干物、地元の農産物や工芸品が並びます。近くの食堂で味わえる活イカの刺身が名物です。",
      "highlights": [
        "呼子港直送の新鮮な海産物",
        "浜の食堂で味わう活イカ刺身",
        "江戸時代から続く伝統的な朝市の雰囲気"
      ],
      "openingHours": "07:30～12:00（毎日、8時頃からが賑わいます）"
    }
